join Sipho (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Sipho (Warm)
Sipho: Your grandmother had a capture system on this house. Did you know that?
- I didn't
	Hope: I didn't.
	Sipho: It's still mostly here. The run's broken in two places and the drum's got no lid, which is worse than it sounds — open water grows things.
	Sipho: It's not a big job. Half a day if the joints hold.
	- Would you help me?
		Hope: Would you help me?
		Sipho: I was going to offer anyway. I want to see how she routed it.
		set {GameState.quest_sipho_gutter_repair} = "active"
		[signal arg="objective:Repair the gutter run, fit a lid to the drum, reposition the drum"]
- Is it worth fixing?
	Hope: Is it worth fixing?
	Sipho: Anything that catches water is worth fixing. This roof throws away a few hundred litres a storm right now.
	set {GameState.quest_sipho_gutter_repair} = "active"
